{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-21","kind":"proposition","title":"互素整数给出既约比","englishTitle":"Numbers prime to one another are the least of those which have the same ratio with them.","book":7,"number":21,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.21","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.21/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":21,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","contentId":"euclid-7-21","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cfe4b14c30c3e4bd05f930d2056a34504cc16d48c48eef8b5e2ce1940b3fc70","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-21.statement","euclid-7-21.construction.1","euclid-7-21.proof.1","euclid-7-21.construction.2","euclid-7-21.proof.2","euclid-7-21.proof.3","euclid-7-21.proof.4","euclid-7-21.proof.5","euclid-7-21.proof.6","euclid-7-21.proof.7","euclid-7-21.proof.8","euclid-7-21.conclusion","euclid-7-21.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-21.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ded06cae19f50affeb787e80db361b87c42ebe021c8eaab09ae3ad02c0df5013","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Numbers prime to one another are the least of those which have the same ratio with them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"互素是最起码的 与它们具有相同比例的人。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94d0b67fede6df31f9f67dcda605d71d7b9350e07de7f041863aee0552c82002","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be numbers prime to one another; I say that A, B are the least of those which have the same ratio with them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为互素;我说,A,B是那些与它们具有相同比例的人中最少的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f41b1a301d4bea36b08fca59d361a84dd78818ee3f27d5b07e36bf14f9d04f8d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, there will be some numbers less than A, B which are in the same ratio with A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,将有不到A,B,与A,B的比例相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff0d194965f84bfcb08e4bcc1beafa6c3edf41237d4c7da6586dd62808c59e37","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be C, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们C,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccd76930157eedb14fc0f037a3799445e660150174f72a8f12be79ef55cdefcc","citations":["euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, the least numbers of those which have the same ratio measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less, that is, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent, [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore C measures A the same number of times that D measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自此以后,同样比为整除的最小数目,相同比的最小数目,相同数目的最小数目,数量越大,数量越小,数量越小,即,前身的先兆和随之而来的数字,因此,C 整除 A的数字是D 整除 B的相同数目。 [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d95da18dc3c98e638fa63344545b67f58ea53b953da00772b38474c3fc93602","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, as many times as C measures A, so many units let there be in E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,C 整除 A, 这么多 单位 允许在E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58745c8305b21f90d6d34bb68701c41d3f5dd2af09b39a83eee7c01ece15abd8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D also measures B according to the units in E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,根据E的单位,D也是整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7e6a51a4c28741da8b5dcec17fbba4b6bb05d08d729276f904fc4c83b180b31d","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since C measures A according to the units in E, therefore E also measures A according to the units in C. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有根据E的单位,自C 整除 A起因此,根据C的单位数据,E也是整除 A。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"363b35166a9b3bd56d7e932d185d5b8d636799d6d91fa0c9952126d30c046cad","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason E also measures B according to the units in D. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"依据D的单位, 同一原因还有E,整除,B。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7febff7422945affb9fd04076a2022f7f0061499811c78e79aaa3f639a67b5c","citations":["euclid-7-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E measures A, B which are prime to one another: which is impossible. [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E 整除 A,B,即互素:这是不可能的。 [[VII. Def. 12](/principles/euclid-7-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d4dceda499428bb1277a46b1ae5a7df813299b4b37886c2a063868b64087fa7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there will be no numbers less than A, B which are in the same ratio with A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,人数将不少于A,B的比例与A和B相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9352e017c7da13127af5192b233d1f42d6cbb839be13602009ae57d3040e218c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B are the least of those which have the same ratio with them. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B与它们的比例最低。 Q,E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-21.source","contentId":"euclid-7-21","revisionId":"euclid-7-21@raw-4cfe4b14c30c3e4b","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54f9d5f0becf493095262faf1f42047c250264ac1b10b4be598c34257e8e978a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.21/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.21\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-21:euclid-7-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-21","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-21.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.21",